+ *           in full. It also names the append-only artefacts that will need renumbering, detected as:
+ *             - migrations: a file the dependant adds under a directory named migrations, migration or
+ *               drizzle whose first segment there starts with digits, when the withdrawn candidate added
+ *               one in the same directory (its number follows a migration that leaves) or the main branch
