+ *               and a migration journal (meta/_journal.json there) both changed;
+ *             - package versions: a package.json whose "version" both changed, the dependant's built on
+ *               the withdrawn one's;
+ *             - reserved IDs: an ID the withdrawn entry recorded (--reserved) that the dependant's own
+ *               added lines mention.
+ *           Nothing else is detected (other append-only lists are read by the person restacking).
